API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9028393Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9035080Z ^[[0m
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9035571Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9036230Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9036672Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9036904Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9037785Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9038113Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9038345Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9038890Z    if you are ready to continue.
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9039071Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9039426Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9039895Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9040312Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9040652Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9040832Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9041045Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9041253Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9041451Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9041799Z    can use Nix.
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9041944Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9042074Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9042249Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9042489Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T07:40:50.9042932Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
